    'Last month I bought a new backpack because my old one was too small for my laptop. Before buying, I read reviews on Shopee and asked two friends for advice. I usually compare prices on two apps, so I did that too. I chose a grey backpack for three hundred thousand dong because it had good reviews and free delivery. I am very satisfied with it. It is light and strong, so I often recommend it to my classmates.',
